hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Waqas Laisi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko mimbar par yeh farmate suna, Aap farma rahe the: Tamam a'mal ka daromadar niyyaton par hai aur beshak insan ke liye wahi (sila) hai jis ki us ne niyyat ki, chunache jis ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf ho to (fil-waqe') us ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf hai aur jis ki hijrat duniya ke husool ya kisi aurat se nikah ki gharz se ho to (fil-waqe') us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki. Yeh hadees sahih hai. Use Bukhari ne Qa'nabi se, unhon ne Malik se riwayat kiya hai."
"2","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tamam a'mal ka daromadar niyyat par hai aur har insan ke liye wahi hai jis ki us ne niyyat ki, chunache jis ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf ho to us ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf hai aur jis ki hijrat duniya ke husool ya kisi aurat se nikah ki gharz se ho to us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki."
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Majlisein amanat hoti hain. Aur Nasibi ki riwayat mein hai ke main (Hazrat Ali Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai."
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samrah bint Jundub (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se mashwara liya jae woh ameen hota hai lehaza agar woh chahe to mashwara de aur agar chahe to khamosh rahe phir agar woh mashwara de to use chahiye ke aisa mashwara de ke agar woh (soorat) khud use pesh aati to woh us par amal karta."
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se khadim ka wa'da farmaya, phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek khadim laya gaya to us aadmi ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Aap mere liye pasand farmaiye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se mashwara liya jae woh ameen hota hai tum use le lo."
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain: Tum mein se koi shakhs apne bachche se aisa wa'da na kare jise woh poora na kar sake, beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai: Wa'da ek atiya hai."
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wa'da ek qarz hai."
"8","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Jang chaal-bazi (ka naam) hai."
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jang chaal-bazi (ka naam) hai. Yeh hadees sahih hai. Use Bukhari ne Sadaqah bin Fazl se riwayat kiya hai."
"10","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jang chaal-bazi (ka naam) hai."
"11","[AI-translation] Wahb (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke jang chaal-bazi (ka naam) hai? To unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"12","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jang chaal-bazi (ka naam) hai."
"13","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ma'qil (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main apne walid ke hamrah Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon ne un ko kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Nadamat tauba hai."
"14","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ma'qil (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke mere walid ne Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai ke nadamat tauba hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"15","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mimbar par farmaya: Jama'at rahmat aur iftiraq azab hai."
"16","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amanat maldari hai."
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen khair-khwahi (ka naam) hai, deen khair-khwahi (ka naam) hai. Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Kis ke liye? Farmaya: Allah ke liye, us ki kitab ke liye, us ke Nabi ke liye, Musalmanon ke a'imma o hukkam aur aam Musalmanon ke liye."
"18","[AI-translation] Imam Sufyan bin Uyainah (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Amr bin Dinar ne Qa'qa' bin Hakim an Abi Salih an Ata bin Yazid ki sanad se unhen hadees bayan ki. Imam Sufyan kehte hain: Phir main un (Abi Salih) ke bete Suhail se mila. Main ne kaha: Kya aap ne apne walid se woh hadees suni hai jo Amr bin Dinar ne Qa'qa' bin Hakim Abi Salih ki sanad se hamein bayan ki hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne woh hadees us se suni hai jis ne mere walid ko bayan ki thi, main ne Ata bin Yazid Laisi ko Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) ke hawale se yeh hadees bayan karte suna tha unhon ne kaha: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen baar farmaya: Deen khair-khwahi (ka naam) hai. Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Kis ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke liye, us ki kitab ke liye, us ke Nabi ke liye, Musalmanon ke a'imma o hukkam aur aam Musalmanon ke liye. Is hadees ko Imam Muslim ne bhi Muhammad bin Abbad Makki se riwayat kiya hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, woh kehte hain ke main ne Suhail se kaha: Beshak Amr ne Qa'qa' se us ne aap ke walid ke hawale se hamein yeh hadees bayan ki hai to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe ummeed hai ke (meri sanad mein) mujh se ek aadmi (ka wasta) kam ho jaega phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne yeh hadees us shakhs se suni jis se mere walid ne suni thi, Sham mein un ka ek dost tha (sara waqe'a bayan kiya) phir Imam Sufyan ne yeh hadees Suhail an Ata bin Yazid an Tamim Dari ki sanad se hamein bayan ki ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh farmaya hai."
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen khair-khwahi (ka naam) hai. Arz kiya gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Kis ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke liye, us ke Rasul ke liye, us ki kitab ke liye, Musalmanon ke a'imma o hukkam aur aam Musalmanon ke liye."
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasab maal hai aur buzrugi taqwa hai."
"21","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasab maal hai aur buzrugi taqwa hai."
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki aadat aur huda jhagda hai."
"23","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Narm hona nafa-mand aur sakht hona nahoosat hai."
"24","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin A'iz (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehtiyat badgumani hai."
"25","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la Amiri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek martaba Hazrat Hasan o Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) daudte hue Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen gale lagaya aur farmaya: Aulad bukhl aur buzdili (ka ba'is) hai."
"26","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Murrah (Raziyallahu anhu) ka bayan hai ke Hazrat Hasan o Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) daudte hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae un mein se ek Aap ke paas (pehle) aa gaya, Aap ne apna hath us ki gardan par rakha phir doosra bhi aa gaya to Aap ne apna (doosra) hath us ki gardan par rakha pas us ka bosa liya phir us ka bosa liya aur phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Main un donon se mohabbat rakhta hun lehaza Aap bhi un se mohabbat rakhen. (Aur farmaya) Logo! Beshak aulad bukhl, jahalat aur buzdili (ka ba'is) hai. (Aur farmaya) Beshak Rabbul Aalameen ne jis zameen ko sab se aakhir mein pamal kiya woh Wajj hai."
"27","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fohsh-goyi bad-akhlaqi mein se hai."
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran dawa hai."
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dua hi ibadat hai."
"30","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dua hi ibadat hai (aur Allah ka farman hai): Tumhare Rabb ne farmaya: Tum mujhe pukaro main tumhari pukar qabool karunga beshak jo log meri ibadat se takabbur karte hain, woh anqareeb zaleel ho kar Jahannam mein dakhil hon ge. (Al-Mu'min: 60) Aur tumhare Rabb ne farmaya: Tum mujhe pukaro main tumhari pukar qabool karunga, beshak jo log meri ibadat se takabbur karte hain woh anqareeb zaleel ho kar Jahannam mein dakhil hon ge."
"31","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qarz deen mein aib hai."
"32","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna aur unhon ne ek lambi hadees mein is baat ka bhi zikr kiya."
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kharch mein miyana-rawi nisf zindagi, logon ke sath bahami ulfat nisf aql aur achcha sawal nisf ilm hai."
"34","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salam kalam se pehle hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raza'at tabiyat ko badal deti hai."
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat tumhare badon ke sath hai."
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat tumhare badon ke sath hai."
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke hum ghazwa-e-Tabook mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle pas Aap ne aag jalayi aur unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke taweel khutbe ka zikr kiya jis mein yeh (amal ka sarmaya us ka ikhtitam hai) bhi bayan ki."
"39","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kitab ka sharaf us ka khatma hai aur yeh Allah Ta'ala ka farman bhi hai: Beshak meri taraf ek bada izzat o sharaf wala khat phenka gaya hai. (An-Naml: 29) Beshak meri taraf ek bada izzat o sharaf wala khat phenka gaya hai."
"40","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ilm ki fazilat ibadat se afzal hai aur deen ka sarmaya parhezgari hai."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khashiyat-e-Ilahi har danayi ki jad aur parhezgari amal ki sardar hai."
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maldar ka qarz ki adayegi mein taal-matol karna zulm hai aur maldar ka bheek mangna us ke chehre par aib ka ba'is hai aur maldar ka bheek mangna Jahannam ki aag hai."
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maldar ka qarz ki adayegi mein taal-matol karna zulm hai."
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Allah Ta'ala ki di hui) nematon ko bayan karna shukr ada karna hai."
"45","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne khutba diya to bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki nematon ko bayan karna shukr ada karna hai aur na bayan karna nashukri hai."
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabr ke sath kushaish o khush-hali ka intezar karna bhi ibadat hai."
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabr ke sath kushaish o khush-hali ka intezar karna bhi ibadat hai."
"48","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai. Yeh hadees sahih hai, use Bukhari ne Qa'nabi se riwayat kiya hai."
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai. Aur yeh (mukammal) hadees bayan ki."
"50","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hajjatul Wada ke saal khutbe mein yeh irshad farmate suna: Udhar li hui cheez wapas ki jae, doodh ke liye liya hua janwar bhi wapas kiya jae, qarz ada kiya jae aur zaamin tawan bharne wala hai."
"51","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Narmi danayi ki jad hai."
"52","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Danayi ki baat har dana ki mata'-e-gum-gashta hai aur jab woh use mile to wahi use lene ka zyada haq-dar hai."
"53","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nawas bin Sam'an Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se neki aur gunah ke mutalliq daryaft kiya to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki husn-e-khuluq (ka naam) hai."
"54","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat husn-e-khuluq mein hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne yeh khutba Tabook mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se sun kar hasil kiya. Main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna aur unhon ne taweel khutbe mein yeh (mazkoorah) baat bhi zikr ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"56","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai aur is mein hai ke Sharab gunahon ka majmua hai."
"57","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sharab tamam khabasaton ki jad hai."
"58","[AI-translation] Hasan Basri kehte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhar maut ka pesh-khaima hai aur yeh zameen par Allah ka qaid-khana bhi hai, woh us mein jab chahta hai apne bande ko qaid kar deta hai aur jab chahta hai chhod deta hai."
"59","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Marqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar fatah kiya aur woh (sahaba) atharah sau the, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (maal-e-ghaneemat) atharah hisson mein taqseem kar diya, har sau ke liye ek hissa bana diya. Kehte hain: Aur woh ilaqa phalon se shadab tha, unhon ne woh khae to bukhar ghalib aa gaya chunache unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us ki shikayat ki to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Beshak bukhar maut ka pesh-khaima hai aur zameen par Allah Ta'ala ka qaid-khana hai. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"60","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhar Jahannam ki bhaap mein se hai lehaza use pani ke sath thanda karo. Yeh hadees sahih hai, use Bukhari ne Malik bin Ismail se riwayat kiya hai."
"61","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhar Jahannam ki bhaap mein se hai lehaza use pani ke sath thanda karo."
"62","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhar har momin ke liye Jahannam ki aag ka badal hai aur ek raat ka bukhar saal bhar ke bade bade gunahon ko mita deta hai."
"63","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qana'at aisa maal hai jo khatm nahin hota."
"64","[AI-translation] Abu Hatim Muhammad bin Umar kehte hain ke hamein Abu Zarr Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Malik Tirmizi ne apni us sanad ke sath bayan kiya jis ka zikr guzar chuka hai unhon ne kaha: Ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh baat apne khutbe mein irshad farmayi thi jis ka zikr pehle ho chuka hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"65","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah ka sona rizq ko rokta hai."
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zina mohtaj kar deta hai."
"67","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aankhon ka zina dekhna hai, zaban ka zina bolna hai, hath ka zina pakadna hai, paon ka zina chalna hai aur beshak sharm-gah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb karti hai."
"68","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imame Arabon ka taaj hain, got maar kar baithna un ki deewaren hain aur momin ka masjid mein baithna us ka sarhad par pehra dena hai."
"69","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya sarasar khair hai."
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya sarasar khair hai. Use Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath bayan kiya hai ke Hazrat Imran (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya khair hi lati hai. Use Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai ke Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"72","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Wasi' kehte hain ke Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko likha: Amma ba'd! Ae mere bhai! Apni sehat ko beemari se pehle ghaneemat samjho aur apni faraghat ko us aazmayish ke nazil hone se pehle ghaneemat samjho jise logon mein se koi bhi talne ki taqat nahin rakhta. Ae mere bhai! Us momin ki dua ko ghaneemat samjho jo kisi aazmayish mein mubtala ho. Ae mere bhai! Masjid tumhara ghar hona chahiye kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai: Masjid har muttaqi ka ghar hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Abu Usman kehte hain ke Hazrat Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf likha ke ae mere bhai! Masjid ko apne oopar lazim kar lo kyunke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai: Masjid har muttaqi ka ghar hai."
"74","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna ... aur unhon ne Hadees-e-Waseeyat mein un baaton ka bhi zikr kiya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"75","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe bulaya aur Aap ne Ali ke liye apni waseeyat ka zikr farmaya aur is riwayat mein un alfaz ka izafa hai: Mubalagha-arayi zarafat ki tabahi hai, israf sakhawat ki tabahi hai aur khwahish-e-nafs deen ki tabahi hai."
"76","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein khutba diya karte to Aap farmaya karte: Nek-bakht woh hai jo doosron se naseehat pakde aur bad-bakht woh hai jo apni maan ke pet mein bad-bakht ho."
