"93","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Achchi baat karna sadqa hai aur namaz ki taraf uthne wala har qadam sadqa hai. Use Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath isi tarah riwayat kiya hai (lekin mazkoorah riwayat) mukhtasar hai."
"94","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi jo kuch bhi apne ghar walon aur apni zaat par kharch kare to us ke iwaz us ke liye sadqa likha jata hai aur jis ke zariye aadmi apni izzat bachae to us ke iwaz bhi us ke liye sadqa likha jata hai. Main (Abdul Hamid) ne Muhammad bin Munkadir se kaha: Jis ke zariye aadmi apni izzat bachae ka kya ma'na hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh ke woh (apni hajv aur be-izzati se bachne ke liye) sha'ir ya bad-zaban shakhs ko kuch de."
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi jis cheez ke zariye apni izzat bachae to us ke iwaz us ke liye sadqa likha jata hai."
"96","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qarabat-daron par sadqa karna sadqa bhi hai aur sila-rahmi bhi."
"97","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) jo ke Hudaibiyah mein shareek hone wale sahaba mein se hain, kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa buri maut ko rokta hai."
