"100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sila-rahmi umar daraz karti hai aur poshida sadqa Rabb Ta'ala ka ghussa bujhata hai."
