"103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Qayamat ke din) aadmi apne sadqe ke sae mein hoga yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla kar diya jae."
"104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ek safar mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hamrah tha, ek din hum chal rahe the to main Aap ke qareeb hua Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tujhe neki ke darwaze na bataun? Roza dhaal hai, sadqa gunah (ki aag) ko is tarah bujhata hai jis tarah pani aag ko bujhata hai aur aadmi ka raat ke dauran mein namaz ada karna."
"105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ka'b bin Ujrah se farmaya: Ae Ka'b! Namaz waseela hai, roza dhaal hai aur sadqa Rabb Ta'ala ka ghussa aise bujhata hai jaise pani aag bujhata hai."
"106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zakat lene mein zyadati karne wala zakat rokne wale ki manind hai."
