"116","[AI-translation] Qazi Abu Muhammad Abdul Karim bin Muntasir ne apni isi sanad ke sath jis ka zikr juz-e-awwal mein guzar chuka hai, Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne us taweel khutbe mein yeh (mazkoorah baat) irshad farmayi jis mein yeh bhi tha ke Jawani junoon ka hissa hai. Aur us ke sath kayi doosri baatein bhi mazkoor thin ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
