"128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin zairak, samajhdar aur chaukanna hota hai."
"129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ulfat karne wala aur ulfat kiya jata hai aur us mein khair nahin jo ulfat na kare aur logon mein behtar woh hai jo un mein se logon ke liye zyada nafa-mand ho."
"130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin woh hai jis se log aman mein hon aur Musalman woh hai jis ke hath aur zaban se log mehfooz hon aur muhajir woh hai jo burayi chhod de aur us zaat ki qasam! Jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh shakhs Jannat mein dakhil nahin ho sakta jis ki eza-rasaniyon se us ka hamsaya mehfooz na ho."
"131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fazalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjatul Wada ke mauqe par farmaya ... aur unhon ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke khutbe ka zikr kiya aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Momin woh hai jis se log apne maalon aur janon ke bare mein be-khauf hon aur muhajir woh hai jo khataon aur gunahon ko chhod de aur mujahid woh hai jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki ita'at mein apne nafs se jihad kare."
"132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin woh hai jis se log apne khoon aur maalon ke bare mein be-khauf hon."
"133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin bhola-bhala aur shareef hota hai aur fajir farebi aur kameena hota hai."
"134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin momin ke liye imarat ki manind hai jis ka ek hissa doosre hisse ko mazboot karta hai."
"135","[AI-translation] Abu Usamah se yeh hadees un ki sanad ke sath ek doosre tareeq se bhi isi tarah marwi hai aur us mein hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (samjhane ke liye) apne ek hath ki ungliyan doosre hath ki ungliyon mein daal kar dikhayen."
"136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ka ahl-e-iman se wahi talluq hai jo sar ka jism se hai, momin ahl-e-iman ki takleef se isi tarah tadap uthta hai jis tarah jism ki takleef se sar tadapta hai."
"137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin Qayamat ke din apne sadqe ke sae mein hoga."
"138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir aur Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ek aant mein khata hai aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai."
"139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin narm-mizaj aur ba-waqar hote hain jaise (nakeel-dar) oont ke agar use chalaya jae to chal padta hai aur agar bithaya jae to baith jata hai."
"140","[AI-translation] Makhul kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin narm-mizaj aur ba-waqar hote hain. (Yeh hadees) mukhtasar hai."
"141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mausam-e-sarma momin ke liye bahar hai."
"142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mausam-e-sarma momin ke liye bahar hai."
"143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dua momin ka asliha hai, deen ka sutoon hai, aasmanon aur zameen ka noor hai."
"144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz momin ka noor hai."
"145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya momin ka qaid-khana aur kafir ki Jannat hai."
"146","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hikmat momin ki gum-shuda cheez hai, momin apni us gum-shuda cheez ko jahan bhi pae us ki taraf us (ko lene) ka azm-e-musammam kare."
"147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Momin ki niyyat us ke amal se zyada baleegh hoti hai."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nawas bin Sam'an Kalabi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki niyyat us ke amal se behtar hai aur fajir ki niyyat us ke amal se buri hai."
"149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki taraf Allah ka hadiya us ke darwaze par sa'il (ko bhejna) hai."
"150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Maut momin ka tohfa hai."
"151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin ka sharaf us ke qiyamul-lail mein hai aur us ki izzat logon se be-niyaz hone mein hai."
"152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ilm momin ka jigri dost hai, aql us ki daleel hai, amal us ka rahnuma hai, rifq us ka baap hai, neki us ka bhai hai, aur sabr us ke lashkaron ka ameer hai."
"153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ilm momin ka jigri dost hai, hilm us ka wazeer hai, aql us ki daleel hai, narmi us ka bhai hai, rifq us ka baap hai, amal us ka nigran hai, aur sabr us ke lashkaron ka ameer hai."
"154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghairat iman mein se hai aur mira' nifaq mein se hai. Rawi kehta hai ke ahl-e-Kufa mein se ek shakhs ne (rawi-e-hadees) Zaid bin Aslam se kaha: Mira' kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Be-ghairti karna, ae Iraqi! Is hadees mein lafz mira' isi tarah ra ke sath aaya hai aur woh jo Abu Ubaid ne maza' zaal ke sath riwayat kiya hai, woh kehte hain ke yeh mazal zaal aur laam ke sath bhi marwi hai. Lekin durust pehla hi hai. Aur us (maza') ka matlab yeh hai ke mard apni biwi par doosre mardon ko dakhil kare aur aise (be-ghairat) mard ko qandi aur dayyus kaha jata hai aur yeh donon kalime Suryani zaban ke hain aur lafz maza' mazi se makhooz hai kyunke woh ek doosre se be-ghairti karte hain. Aur haan lafz mazal laam ke sath un ke qaul se hai jab aadmi, pareshan ho kar, raaz zahir kar de. (Yeh lafz istemal hota hai) jab shakhs, bechain aur pareshan ho kar, raaz khol de. Qazi Abu Abdullah kehte hain: Durust lafz maza' hai zaal-e-mu'jam ke sath, aur mira' ra ke sath katib ki ghalti hai."
"155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek Ansari ke paas se guzre jo apne bhai ko haya ke bare mein wa'z kar raha tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhod do, beshak haya iman mein se hai."
"156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai. Aur Imam Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat kiya hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko suna jo apne bhai ko haya ke bare mein wa'z kar raha tha to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai."
"157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadgi iman mein se hai, sadgi iman mein se hai, sadgi iman mein se hai."
"158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabr nisf iman hai aur yaqeen mukammal iman hai."
"159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Anas! Iman do nisf hisse hai: Nisf shukr aur nisf sabr. (Iman do nisf hisse hai: Nisf shukr aur nisf sabr hai.)"
"160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare paas ahl-e-Yaman aae hain, woh bade raqeequl-qalb hain, iman ahl-e-Yaman ka hai, fiqh ahl-e-Yaman ki hai aur hikmat bhi ahl-e-Yaman ki hai."
"161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman ahl-e-Yaman ka hai, fiqh ahl-e-Yaman ki hai aur hikmat bhi ahl-e-Yaman ki hai."
"162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare paas ahl-e-Yaman aae hain ... mukammal hadees bayan ki aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Iman ahl-e-Yaman ka hai aur hikmat bhi ahl-e-Yaman ki hai. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se Yaman ki taraf ishara kiya aur farmaya: Iman us taraf hai. Yeh riwayat mukhtasar hai."
"164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Humaq (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman ne dhoke se qatl karne ko band kar diya hai jis shakhs ne kisi aadmi ko us ke khoon ki aman di phir use qatl kar diya to main qatil se la-talluq hun maqtool agarche kafir hi ho."
"165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Namaz iman ka jhanda hai."
"166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban aur hath se Musalman mehfooz rahen aur muhajir woh hai jo Allah ki haram kardah cheezon ko chhod de."
"167","[AI-translation] Rasheed Hijri apne walid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha: Hamein woh hadees sunayen jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni ho to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban aur hath se Musalman mehfooz hon."
"168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, na woh us par zulm kare aur na us par zulm hone de."
"169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, na woh us par zulm kare aur na us par zulm hone de aur jo shakhs apne bhai ki zaroorat poori karne mein rehta hai Allah us ki zaroorat poori karne mein rehta hai aur jis ne kisi Musalman ki dunyawi museebaton mein se kisi museebat ko door kiya Allah us ki roz-e-Qayamat ki museebaton mein se koi museebat door karega aur jis ne kisi Musalman ka parda rakha Allah roz-e-Qayamat us ka parda rakhega."
"170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fatah-e-Makkah ke din khutba diya to Aap ne us mein yeh baat bhi irshad farmayi ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"171","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maut har Musalman ke liye (gunahon ka) kaffara hai."
"172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur (phir) unhon ne (yeh hadees) bayan ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
