"176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman ka doosre Musalman par khoon, izzat o aabroo aur maal haram hai."
"177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke maal ki hurmat us ke khoon ki hurmat jaisi hai."
"178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke maal ki hurmat us ke khoon ki hurmat jaisi hai."
"179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban aur hath se doosre Musalman mehfooz rahen aur muhajir woh hai jo un cheezon ko chhod de jo Allah ne us par haram ki hain."
