"181","[AI-translation] Sha'bi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke ek aadmi ne Hazrat Ibn Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha: Mujhe koi aisi cheez batlayiye jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni ho, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban aur hath se Musalman mehfooz rahen aur muhajir woh hai jo un cheezon ko chhod de jin se Allah ne mana farmaya hai."
"182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin woh hai jis se log aman mein rahen aur Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban se Musalman mehfooz rahen aur muhajir woh hai jo burayi ko chhod de aur us zaat ki qasam! Jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh banda Jannat mein dakhil nahin ho sakta jis ki eza-rasaniyon se us ka hamsaya mehfooz na ho."
"183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fazalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjatul Wada mein farmaya ... aur unhon ne Aap ke khutbe ka zikr kiya aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Mujahid woh hai jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki ita'at mein apne nafs se jihad kare."
"184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fazalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Mujahid woh hai jo Allah Ta'ala (ki ita'at) mein apne nafs se jihad kare."
"185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aus (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Aql-mand woh hai jo apne nafs ka muhasiba kare aur maut ke baad (wali zindagi) ke liye tayyari kare aur be-waqoof woh hai jo khud ko khwahishat ke peeche laga le aur (phir bhi) Allah Ta'ala se ummeed rakhe."
"186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan apne bhai ke sath quwwat hasil kar leta hai."
"187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan apne dost ke deen par hota hai, lehaza tum mein se har ek yeh zaroor dekh le ke woh kis se dosti kar raha hai."
"188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan apne dost ke deen par hota hai."
"189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Qayamat ke din) insan apne mehboob ke sath hoga. Use Muslim bin Hajjaj ne Usman bin Abi Shaibah aur Ishaq bin Ibrahim se riwayat kiya hai, Ishaq ne kaha: Akhbarana aur Usman ne kaha: Haddasana Jarir. (Aage Jarir ne) A'sham se un ki sanad ke sath isi ki misl riwayat kiya hai."
"190","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan ki izzat us ka deen hai, us ki murawwat us ki aql hai, aur us ka hasab o nasab us ka akhlaq hai."
"191","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan ka fazool kaamon ko chhod dena us ke Islam ke achcha hone ki daleel hai. Imam Tabarani ne kaha: Muhammad bin Kaseer bin Marwan is riwayat ko Ibnuz Zinad se bayan karne mein munfarid hai, aur hum ne use Muhammad bin Abdah hi se naql kiya hai, aur Zaid bin Sabit ki riwayat sirf isi sanad ke sath marwi hai, aur Ibn Abiuz Zinad ka ek doosra beta bhi hai jis ki kunyat Abul Qasim hai aur us ka naam nahin liya gaya, us se Ahmad bin Hanbal ne riwayat kiya hai."
"192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan ka fazool kaamon ko chhod dena us ke Islam ke achcha hone ki daleel hai."
"193","[AI-translation] Ali bin Husain se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan ka fazool kaamon ko chhod dena us ke Islam ke achcha hone ki daleel hai."
"194","[AI-translation] Ali bin Husain apne walid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Insan ka fazool kaamon ko chhod dena us ke Islam ke achcha hone ki daleel hai."
"195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log kanghi ke dandanon ki tarah (barabar) hain."
"196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log sone-chandi ki kanon ki tarah (mukhtalif) kanein hain, un mein se daur-e-jahiliyat ke behtar log Islam mein bhi behtar hain basharteke unhen deen ki samajh-boojh ho."
"197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log un sau oonton ki tarah hain jin mein se sawari ke laiq tujhe ek bhi na mile."
"198","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log un sau oonton ki tarah hain jin mein se aadmi ko sawari ke laiq ek bhi nahin milta."
"199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Bande ki) ghina yeh hai ke jo kuch logon ke hathon mein hai us se woh na-ummeed rahe aur tum mein se jo shakhs kisi lalach ki taraf chale to use chahiye ke aahista chale."
"200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman ke baad aql ki bunyad logon se mohabbat karna hai."
